  "notes": "A formal word commonly used in news, business, and academic contexts. Often paired with negative outcomes like risks, conflicts, and crises. Distinguished from {避|さ}ける, which is more general and less formal.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- リスクを{回避|かいひ}する: to avoid risk\n- {危険|きけん}を{回避|かいひ}する: to avoid danger\n- {衝突|しょうとつ}を{回避|かいひ}する: to avoid a collision/clash\n- {責任|せきにん}{回避|かいひ}: avoidance of responsibility",
